          "text": "INSTANT · ON-DEVICE AI Here is a classic, easy-to-follow pancake recipe: The Easy Pancakes • Prep time: 10 minutes • Cook time: 6–8 minutes per side • Servings: 4–6 Ingredients: • 2 eggs (room temperature) • ½ cup all-purpose flour (or pancake mix) • Salt and pepper to taste • 1 tsp oil or butter (for greasing pan) Method: Heat a non-stick skillet over medium heat. Pour in the oil/butter and let it warm slightly. Crack one egg into the center, then add the flour mixture on top of the egg. Let them cook together until they look like pancakes (about 1–2 minutes). Flip to cook the other side quickly without turning off the heat immediately; this creates a \"milk\" texture that is tender and fluffy. Remove from heat and let cool slightly before serving. Ledger"
